Chapter: SpirvGpuIntProbe

 An integer kernel, to exercise the i64 buffer path (runtime array of
 signed 64-bit ints, its Block struct and StorageBuffer pointers) that the
 float kernels never touch. Same gid convention: one i64 input, one i64
 output.

Section: Kernel

  gpu-inc : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  gpu-inc (n) (gid) =
   n + 1
